# EXCEPTION: the committed stable *sideload* release key. Intentionally in the
# repo so every build signs identically and 覆盖安装 (in-place upgrade) works.
# It is NOT a Play Store key — its password is public. For store uploads use
# your own key via key.properties (takes precedence; see app/build.gradle.kts).
!keystore/explore-release.jks

# gomobile-built embedded frpc — produced by CI (docs/frp_embed.md), not
